error: `spawn` needs a task that produces (), and this one produces I64
  --> tasks.norn:28:9
   |
28 |         spawn counted()
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ nothing would receive the value
   = note: there are no task handles in v0, so a spawned task has to say what happens to its own result

